Build a data pipeline for the temperature sensor:
1. Create a transform converting temp_c Celsius to Fahrenheit (code `return input * 1.8 + 32`, output-prefix fahrenheit, scope global);
2. Create a rule (named temp-f-high): alert when Fahrenheit (transform output) > 85 - the rule's source MUST point at the transform output (containing fahrenheit), not the raw temp_c directly;
3. Route alerts to the temp-f-alerts webhook channel (URL: https://example.com/t).
